# kb/ is the ~500MB SOURCE that CI zips into the GitHub Release bundles
# (releases/download/kb-latest/*.zip) — it is NOT meant to be served live and
# already 404s on Vercel. Excluding it keeps deploys small and well under
# Vercel's size limits. Human-facing studio media is served from assets/media/.
